  m_text: '"Greetings, fleshy traveler! You want to rebuild your ship? The metal
    scraps you need are just across the river. Small problem: our bridge shattered
    into pieces! If you can find 3 Red Mana Crystals, their energy will fuse the
    bridge back together. Oh, and that giant glowing barrier blocking the base? It
    won''t budge unless you bring your Etharno Orb from your rocket to overpower
    its energy grid! Go, hurry!"'
